    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6302" root="جمش" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمُوشٌ</span></b> , applied to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُورَة</span> [q. v.], <i>That removes
hair;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمِيشٌ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Applied
to a year (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَةٌ</span>), (assumed tropical:)  <i>That shaves off,</i> (S,) or <i>nips,
shrinks, shrivels,</i> or <i>blasts,</i> [lit., <i>burns,</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْرَقَ</span>,]
(K,) <i>the plants,</i> or <i>herbage.</i> (S, K.)

